Subject: [PATCH 10/11] gestures: add torch and app targets to double tap power

the double tap power screen only lists camera and wallet, so there is
no way to pick the torch or app targets the framework now handles.

add flashlight and open an app selectors, the latter with a launcher
app picker, and show the chosen target in the gestures summary.
